\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 02 — CÁC CHƯƠNG TRÌNH ============== -->\r\n<section class=\"story-section bg-table short\" data-section=\"Program\">\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap text-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center;\">Program</div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"reveal serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(28px,7vw,42px); font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); line-height:1.15; margin-bottom:16px;\">\r\n      New Zealand<br>investor visa programs\r\n    </h2>\r\n    <p class=\"reveal reveal-1\" style=\"color:var(--text); max-width:640px; margin:0 auto;\">\r\n      Three New Zealand investor visa programs: 2 open to applications (Business Investor Visa, Active Investor Plus Visa) and 1 closed (Entrepreneur Work Visa — kept for reference).\r\n    </p>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 02.A — NHÓM A ============== -->\r\n<section class=\"story-section bg-navy short dark-sec sec-group-lead\" data-section=\"Group A\">\r\n  <div class=\"number-bg light\">A</div>\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap text-center\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal eyebrow on-dark\" style=\"justify-content:center;\"><span class=\"num\">A</span> Programs now open</div>\r\n    <h2 class=\"reveal serif\" style=\"font-size:clamp(26px,7vw,38px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.18; color:#fff; margin-bottom:14px;\">\r\n      Investor visa programs<br><span style=\"color:var(--gold-soft);\">open to applications</span>\r\n    </h2>\r\n    <p class=\"reveal reveal-1\" style=\"line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin:0 auto 26px; max-width:600px;\">\r\n      Two New Zealand investor visa programs are open to applications. Both give the whole family residence, with a route to permanent residence and citizenship.\r\n    </p>\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 grid2\" style=\"max-width:760px; margin:0 auto;\">\r\n      <a class=\"choice-white\" href=\"#prog-aip\"><div class=\"choice-text\"><div class=\"pn\">Active Investor Plus Visa</div><div class=\"sub\">Financial investment · from NZ$5 million</div></div><span class=\"choice-arrow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\r\n      <a class=\"choice-white\" href=\"#prog-biv\"><div class=\"choice-text\"><div class=\"pn\">Business Investor Visa</div><div class=\"sub\">Entrepreneur · from NZ$1 million</div></div><span class=\"choice-arrow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6\"/></svg></span></a>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n</section>\r\n\r\n<!-- ============== 02 — ACTIVE INVESTOR PLUS VISA ============== -->\r\n<section id=\"prog-aip\" class=\"story-section bg-light-2 sec-group-follow\" data-section=\"Active Investor Plus\" style=\"scroll-margin-top:20px;\">\r\n  <div class=\"number-bg\">01</div>\r\n  <div class=\"content-wrap\">\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-1\">\r\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"num\">01</span> Group A · Open</div>\r\n      <div class=\"program-name\" style=\"font-size:clamp(24px,6.5vw,45px);\">Active Investor Plus Visa</div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 stat-row\">\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Investment</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">From 5 million</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">NZD</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Purpose</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">Residence</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">New Zealand</div></div>\r\n      <div class=\"stat-row-item\"><div class=\"stat-row-label\">Processing</div><div class=\"stat-row-value\">Case by case</div><div class=\"stat-row-unit\">&amp; INZ workload</div></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-2 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 14l4-4 3 3 5-6\"/></svg> Growth category — NZ$5 million, held for 3 years</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Direct investment in New Zealand private companies</li>\r\n        <li>Managed funds and venture capital funds approved by NZTE</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 3v18h18\"/><path d=\"M7 14l4-4 3 3 5-6\"/></svg> Balanced category — NZ$10 million, held for 5 years</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Direct investment, managed funds, listed shares</li>\r\n        <li>Bonds and philanthropic giving</li>\r\n        <li>New property development projects</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z\"/></svg> Family members you can include</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Spouse</li>\r\n        <li>Children under 24, unmarried and financially dependent</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3\">\r\n      <div class=\"label-sm\">Key benefits</div>\r\n      <div class=\"benefit-list\">\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Your resident visa is issued once you have made the first investment</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Indefinite residence, with unrestricted travel for the first 4 or 6 years,