 Zealand permanent residence</li>\r\n        <li>INZ has accepted applications since November 2025</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"/></svg> How you invest</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Buy a New Zealand business outright, or hold at least 25% of its shares</li>\r\n        <li>Standard route: NZ$1 million; after 3 years running the business, you apply for a Resident Visa</li>\r\n        <li>Fast route: NZ$2 million; after 12 months running the business, you apply for a Resident Visa</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3 note-box mb-6\">\r\n      <div class=\"label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2M9 11a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8z\"/></svg> Job creation requirements</div>\r\n      <ul class=\"mini-list\">\r\n        <li>Maintain 5 full-time jobs</li>\r\n        <li>Create at least 1 new job for a New Zealand citizen or permanent resident</li>\r\n      </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"reveal reveal-3\">\r\n      <div class=\"label-sm\">Key benefits</div>\r\n      <div class=\"benefit-list\">\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>The whole family can live, study, and work in New Zealand</div></div>\r\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\"><div class=\"benefit-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5L20 7\"/></svg></div><div>Free public healthcare and free public schooling for your children through the end of secondary school</div></div>\r\n        